title: "Attention vs. Integrated Gradients for PUM2 Binding-Site Prediction"
abstract: >-
  Code and result logs for a comparison of attention weights against Integrated
  Gradients attributions for RNA-binding protein binding-site prediction,
  validated against the experimentally characterized PUM2 binding motif.
